---
import { stats } from '../lib/catalog';
---

<figure class="loading">
  <div class="task">
    <span class="label">You ask</span>
    <p>“Add a newsletter signup form to the footer.”</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="layers">
    <li class="layer shelf">
      <div class="head">
        <h4>The shelf labels</h4>
        <p>Always in context. One line per installed skill, so the agent knows what exists without reading any of it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sample">
        <code class="dim">vite: Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR…</code>
        <code class="hit">frontend-failure-modes: Failure-mode checklists for frontend work… forms…</code>
        <code class="dim">triage: Decide what an incoming request deserves…</code>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="layer drawer">
      <div class="head">
        <h4>The drawer</h4>
        <p>Loaded only when your task matches the label. Here, the skill body is a routing table.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sample">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>The brief or diff touches…</th><th>Read</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="hit"><td>Forms, inputs, validation, submission flows, file uploads</td><td><code>forms-and-input.md</code></td></tr>
            <tr class="dim"><td>Routes, links, URL parameters, navigation flows</td><td><code>routing-and-navigation.md</code></td></tr>
            <tr class="hit"><td>Any interactive element, form, dynamic content</td><td><code>accessibility.md</code></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="layer box">
      <div class="head">
        <h4>The box inside</h4>
        <p>Opened only when a row fires. Every item ends in a check the agent must clear before calling the work done.</p>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="sample">
        <p><strong>Double submit.</strong> A slow response plus an impatient user creates the resource twice; disable-on-click alone leaves the button dead after a failed request.</p>
        <p class="check">Check: submission is guarded by in-flight state and re-enabled on failure; the operation is idempotent end to end.</p>
      </blockquote>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    This is why {stats.skills} installed skills do not drown the model: it reads labels, opens one drawer and two boxes, and leaves the rest shut.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .loading {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--sumi-soft);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .task p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.2rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .layers {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .layer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--grout);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .layer + .layer {
    border-top: none;
  }

  .drawer {
    margin-inline: 1rem;
  }

  .box {
    margin-inline: 2rem;
    background: var(--ai-wash);
    border-color: #b8c5dc;
  }

  .head h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .head p {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--sumi-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sample {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sample code {
    display: block;
    background: none;
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .dim {
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .hit {
    color: var(--ai-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  code.hit::before,
  tr.hit td:first-child::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.5em;
    height: 0.5em;
    background: var(--ochre);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    margin-right: 0.5em;
    vertical-align: 0.1em;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  th {
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--sumi-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  td {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem 0.3rem 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  td code {
    padding: 0;
  }

  blockquote p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .check {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ai-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--sumi-soft);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .layer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .drawer,
    .box {
      margin-inline: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
